endptPHONESCREENMODE  OBJECT-TYPE
          SYNTAX      INTEGER
          MAX-ACCESS  read-only
          STATUS      current
          DESCRIPTION "Specifies the default layout of the main phone's screen which can be either full width or half width (two columns)
                       Range is 0-3, with 0 as default, where
                       '0' Full width, adjustable by the user
                       '1' Half width, adjustable by the user
                       '2' Full width, forced
                       '3' Half width, forced"
          ::= { endptID 198 }

endptRINGREMINDERRINGTONE OBJECT-TYPE
