          ::= { endptResetLogEntry 2 }  
endptStartupLogTable   OBJECT-TYPE
          SYNTAX SEQUENCE OF EndptStartupLogEntry
          MAX-ACCESS    not-accessible
          STATUS        current
          DESCRIPTION   "Each entry is one of up to 75 syslog event 
            messages added before the last reset or power-up, each 
            of which has severity code less than the value of the  
                        administered log level and which matchs for level 
