                    SYNTAX      INTEGER
                    MAX-ACCESS  read-only
                    STATUS      current
                    DESCRIPTION "Specifies behaviour of Shared Call Appearances for all Shared Lines.
                    This parameter should only be used if SHARED_LINE_MODE is BLA
                    Values
                    0 - (Default) Phone screen shows 1 Shared Call Appearance and Call Appearance can perform Blind Transfer only
                    1 - Phone screen shows 1 Shared Call Appearance and Call Appearance can perform Blind Transfer, Consult Transfer and Conference calls."
                    ::= { endptSIP 184 }

endptENABLEHOLDREMINDERDISPLAY  OBJECT-TYPE
                    SYNTAX      INTEGER
                    MAX-ACCESS  read-only
                    STATUS      current
                    DESCRIPTION "Specifies whether to display  hc [Return] on call appearance when the phone reminds the user about a held call
                    This parameter is only for OpenSIP environments.
                    0 - called party name / number will be displayed on call appearance when the phone reminds the user about a held call
                    1 - (Default) called party name / number with hc [Return] would be displayed on call appearance when the phone reminds the user about a held call"
                    ::= { endptSIP 185 }

