                    Value equal to 0 means no delay.
                    Value equal to -1 means use SCA<n>_INCOMING_CALL_INDICATION_DELAYED_DEFAULT
                    Range: -1 - 99
                    Default: -1"
                    ::= { endptSIP 220 }

