endptSHAREDLINE9USERNAME  OBJECT-TYPE
                    SYNTAX      DisplayString (SIZE(0..255))
                    MAX-ACCESS  read-only
                    STATUS      current
                    DESCRIPTION "The username to be used for authentication when challenged for credentials on SIP requests 
                    associated with the shared line.
                    This value is optional and if not specified the SCA9_SIPUSERID would be used for authentication.
                    The setting only applies to 3PCC server environments."
                    ::= { endptSIP 239 }

