endptBROADWORKSDONOTDISTURBAVAILABLE  OBJECT-TYPE
                SYNTAX      INTEGER
                MAX-ACCESS  read-only
                STATUS      current
                DESCRIPTION "Is BroadWorks Do Not Disturb feature available. 0 - False, 1 - True."
